Third-party material in this repository

docs/images/*: screenshots of Lily Pad Leap, a game built with this skill. Its trees, bushes, rocks
  and flowers are Kenney's Nature Kit (CC0 1.0, https://kenney.nl/assets/nature-kit).

references/creative-methods.md adapts ideas, in new words, from:
  creative-director-skill by Serge Shima (CC-BY-4.0, https://github.com/smixs/creative-director-skill),
  Claude-Code-Game-Studios by Donchitos (MIT, https://github.com/Donchitos/Claude-Code-Game-Studios),
  blender-kiln by elithril (MIT, https://github.com/elithril/blender-kiln).
references/open-modules.md lists third-party Luau modules (Trove, ProfileStore, TopbarPlus); their
  licences apply to any copy you vendor into a game.

Downloaded at runtime, not included:
  tools/rbxdocs clones Roblox's creator documentation (https://github.com/Roblox/creator-docs),
  licensed CC-BY-4.0 by Roblox Corporation, into ~/.cache/roblox-gamesmith on your machine.

